    2+: Monsters destroyed by battle with that monster are banished after damage
    calculation.\r\n\u25CF 3: After damage calculation, if that monster destroys
    your opponent's monster by battle: Destroy all cards your opponent controls.\r\nYou
    can only activate 1 \"Decode Destruction\" per turn."
